            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "avuga n’ijwi rirenga, abarira uwo muntu w’ Imana yavuye i Buyuda, at’ Uku ni k’Uhoraho agize, ngo Ko wanse kwumvira ijambo ryiwe, ntiwitondere icagezwe ciwe, Uhoraho Imana yawe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ariko ng’ Ukagaruka, ukarya ivyo kurya ukanywera n’amazi ahantu yakubujije, ngo Ntuz’ ugire ico urya cank’ ico unywa; ngo Nuko rero, umuvyimba wawe ntuzoruha ushika mu mva ya ba sogokuruza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma amaze kurya no kunywa, wa muvugishwa yamugaruye amushirira amatandiko ku ndogoba; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nukw aragenda; araheza ahūra n’intambge, iramwica, umuvyimba wiwe urambarara mu nzira, indogoba iwuhagarara i ruhande; intambge na yo ihagarara i ruhande y’uwo muvyimba nyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ abantu bahaciye, babona uwo muvyimba urambaraye mu nzira, n’intambge iwuhagaze i ruhande; baragenda babivuga mu gisagara ah’ uwo muvugishwa w’umutāma yaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
