              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ uwo muvugishwa yamugaruriye mu nzira avyumvise, aravuga, ati Ni wa muntu w’ Imana atumviye ijambo ry’Uhoraho; ni co gitumye Uhoraho amutērēra intambge, ikamutabagura, ikamwica, nk’ukw ijambo ryiwe ryamubariye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Araheza abarira abahungu biwe, ati Ni munshirire amatandiko ku ndogoba; nuko bayashira kuri yo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw aragenda, asanga uwo muvyimba urambaraye mu nzira, na ya ndogoba n’intambge bihagaze i ruhande yawo; arikw iyo ntambge ntiyari yariye uwo muvyimba, canke ngw itabagure iyo ndogoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuk’ uwo muvugishwa w’umutāma aterura umuvyimba w’uwo muntu w’Imana, awuremēka iyo ndogoba, arawuhindukirana, awujana mu gisagara, ngw amuririre, amuhambe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
