              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mu Giheburayo handitswe ngw Amagufa yanje.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wanje muze muwurambike i ruhande y’amagufa yiwe. ",
