        {
          "text": "Kukw ivyo yavuze n’ijwi rirenga ata kizobibuza gushika, abivugishijwe n’ijambo ry’Uhoraho, abarira ico gicaniro c’i Beteli n’utunyabugoro twose two mu bitabo vyo mu bisagara vy’i Samariya.",
