          "text": "No hanyuma y’ivyo, Yerobowamu ntiyahindukiye ngw areke inzira yiwe mbi, arikw akomeza gupfa gutoranya mu bantu bose abo agira abaherezi bo mu bitabo; uwabigomba wese yaramurobanura, kugira ngw abe umuherezi wo mu bitabo. ",
